# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 0420:08C3"
msgid "Greetings stranger. I am called Beren, and you? "
msgstr "你好，陌生人。我叫貝倫，你呢？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk))
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "ask 0420"
msgid "My name is {name}."
msgstr "我叫{name}。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 0420"
msgid "I cannot tell you. "
msgstr "我不能告訴你。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "It does not matter. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 0420"
msgid "It does not matter. "
msgstr "那不重要。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:0AD5"
msgid "Well met, {name}. And what do you seek of me? "
msgstr "幸會，{name}。那麼，你找我有什麼事？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:0AD5"
msgid "As you say. It does not matter to me either. And what do you seek of me? "
msgstr "如你所說，對我來說也不重要。那麼，你找我有什麼事？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:0AD5"
msgid "Interesting, you wish to remain a mystery. I like mysteries, to a point. And what do you seek of me? "
msgstr "有意思，你想保持神祕。我喜歡謎團，在一定程度內。那麼，你找我有什麼事？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:0AD5"
msgid "I see. Perhaps the question was a little too intellectual for you. Ah, well. It matters not to me. And what do you seek of me? "
msgstr "我明白了。也許這個問題對你來說太深奧了。唉，算了，對我來說無所謂。那麼，你找我有什麼事？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:10DF"
msgid "I will now give you the most important lesson of your life. Learn it well, I'll only be able to teach it to you once, fool! "
msgstr "現在我要給你上你這輩子最重要的一課。好好學著，因為我只能教你這一次，蠢貨！"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "Yes, {name}, is there something you want?"
msgstr "什麼事，{name}，你有什麼需要嗎？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "Alas, never to have a moment of peace. What do you want, {name}?"
msgstr "唉，一刻都不得安寧。你要做什麼，{name}？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "Did you forget something, {name}? It does tend to happen when the mind is over-taxed."
msgstr "你忘了什麼嗎，{name}？腦袋負擔太重時，確實常會這樣。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "Yes, is there something you want? "
msgstr "什麼事，你有什麼需要嗎？"

# P13 batch 3
