msgstr "唉，一刻都不得安寧。你要做什麼？"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "Did you forget something? It does tend to happen when the mind is over-taxed. "
msgstr "你忘了什麼嗎？腦袋負擔太重時，確實常會這樣。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "I believe you have over-stayed your welcome. Unwanted guests are not treated with kindness here, {name}."
msgstr "我想你已經待得太久，不受歡迎了。這裡可不會善待不速之客，{name}。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "My patience is at an end. Whatever you want, be quick about it. "
msgstr "我的耐性已經到了極限。不管你要什麼，快說。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1282"
msgid "This is unbearable. Have you never heard of polite behavior, {name}? It has the wonderful benefit of allowing differing peoples to exist together harmoniously. The alternative is strife. You seem to choose the latter."
msgstr "真是難以忍受。你從沒聽說過什麼叫禮貌嗎，{name}？禮貌有個絕妙的好處，就是讓不同的人能和睦共處。否則就只有衝突。看來你選擇了後者。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
