# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1302"
msgid "Your manners could do with some refinement, {name}."
msgstr "你的禮貌還有待磨練，{name}。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 0420:136E"
msgid "I am a Sorcerer. If you cannot adress me as such, do not adress me at all. "
msgstr "我是巫師。如果你不能以巫師之禮稱呼我，那就乾脆別跟我說話。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1403"
msgid "Until you can be civil, {name}, I suggest that you do not speak to me. I have been known to lose my temper on occasion."
msgstr "在你學會客氣之前，{name}，我建議你別跟我說話。大家都知道我偶爾會發脾氣。"

