# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:15A8"
msgid "You have a simple choice to make, {name}. Leave here or die."
msgstr "你只有一個簡單的選擇，{name}：離開，或是死。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:162E"
msgid "Do you seek death? If so, you are dealing with the right mage, {name}. I will gladly oblige you."
msgstr "你在找死嗎？如果是，那你找對法師了，{name}。我很樂意成全你。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:16FD"
msgid "You are like the torax, being led to slaughter, {name}. Except that you should have the reasoning to avoid it. I suggest that you think carefully before we resume our discourse."
msgstr "你就像被牽去屠宰的托拉克斯獸，{name}。只不過你應該有足夠的理智避開這種下場。我建議你在我們繼續談話前，先仔細想清楚。"

