msgstr "等你真的想跟我說話時再來吧。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1C67"
msgid "Your perceptions are shallow, {name}, if you cannot see that you approach the point at which I will cease to tolerate your existence."
msgstr "你的洞察力真是膚淺，{name}，竟然看不出我就快要無法容忍你的存在了。"

# P13 batch 3
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 0420:1CFE"
msgid "If you were to die at this point, I do not believe there would be anyone to mourn your passing. Farewell, {name}."
msgstr "如果你現在死了，我想不會有任何人為你哀悼。再會，{name}。"

